                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "7c02681e-f4ec-3f0e-a345-48edb19b99c9",
                        "entry_id": "cf6dfb8c-5d00-32d7-b03b-2225f4abb1f7",
                        "glosses": [
                            "неодобр. стремление сделать карьеру, добиться личного успеха, продвинуться в какой-либо сфере деятельности любыми средствами (часто — не считаясь с интересами других)"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "bbd6364a-4995-4039-ac72-c0f5a714bb29",
                                "sense_id": "7c02681e-f4ec-3f0e-a345-48edb19b99c9",
                                "text": "Конечно, Кисин — гений и ему некого расталкивать локтями, ибо там, где он плывёт, нет никого. В тридцать лет у него начисто отсутствует карьеризм. Он талант не изломанный, а гармоничный."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "21d5a39c-e37c-4ff4-bcaf-5fd7e1a5f0a1",
                        "source_entry_id": "cf6dfb8c-5d00-32d7-b03b-2225f4abb1f7",
                        "source_sense_id": "7c02681e-f4ec-3f0e-a345-48edb19b99c9",
                        "target_lang_word": "careerism",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "careerism",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c78494dc-6444-3acb-b1a5-0c5e25700341",
                                        "entry_id": "9968ffc8-3552-305a-8c52-9ccf67be8cfb",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The overwhelming desire or urge to advance one's own career or social status, usually at the expense of other personal interests, social growth, or ethics."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "derogatory",
                                            "uncountable",
                                            "usually"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e5a8fb57-2455-412a-a319-4bc66d319865",
                                                "sense_id": "c78494dc-6444-3acb-b1a5-0c5e25700341",
                                                "text": "More than most of his flag officer peers, he understood how to navigate Washington politics and news media, helping him rise through the ranks and obtain resources he needed, although fellow Army leaders often resented what they saw as a grasping careerism."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0f3ea3e2-91e5-4d8e-bc06-10ae9b631c9e",
                                                "sense_id": "c78494dc-6444-3acb-b1a5-0c5e25700341",
                                                "text": "Fear of the other and the future, anger at what had been done to oneself and one’s compatriots, simple ambition and careerism all could be found among those who murdered Armenians."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "957e8eb8-0ced-395c-b824-a26d34ae762d",
                                        "entry_id": "9968ffc8-3552-305a-8c52-9ccf67be8cfb",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The perception that being a member of the military is a career, rather than an obligation to serve one's country."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "US",
                                            "uncountable",
                                            "usually"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ce0de10f-f5e8-452a-b11b-5ad0453be2e9",
                                                "sense_id": "957e8eb8-0ced-395c-b824-a26d34ae762d",
                                                "text": "In addition, military aviators' concerns about careerism as well as their lack of professionalism and personality clashes added to the friction against program."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
